    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadra Break is a Tetris-like game with a twist, crafted to help you unwind. With a variety of gameplay modes, it\u2019s all about delivering a soothing and enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/5b9eaf0826b8905ae4859e2d51a0402f.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/4e0c9fe7bcee9ea01ba9f640f420a296.poster.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/4e0c9fe7bcee9ea01ba9f640f420a296.webm?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/4e0c9fe7bcee9ea01ba9f640f420a296.mp4?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/d0e49e995e25dcae99c14f41ef2bfbb8.poster.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/d0e49e995e25dcae99c14f41ef2bfbb8.webm?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/d0e49e995e25dcae99c14f41ef2bfbb8.mp4?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve retained the authentic feel and mechanics, letting you relive the nostalgia while mastering advanced moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas