steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/5821061edc8450f83f5518b33003cb33.poster.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/5821061edc8450f83f5518b33003cb33.webm?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/5821061edc8450f83f5518b33003cb33.mp4?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends for online or offline play, whether cooperative or competitive. Share enjoyable moments together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/fb551e56df11fb9f3c0a6690d98af405.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/ddd496f340c5d74f404e84aea110ee80.poster.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/ddd496f340c5d74f404e84aea110ee80.webm?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/ddd496f340c5d74f404e84aea110ee80.mp4?t=1755437059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/0c6f1a767e05fd65736de01651f653d7.poster.avif?t=1755437059\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/0c6f1a767e05fd65736de01651f653d7.webm?t=1755437059\" type=\"vide